# Ixalli's Lorekeeper: "Spend this mana only to ... activate an ability of a Dinosaur source" (CR 106.6). Its ruling: a
# "Dinosaur source" is any object with the creature type Dinosaur, so the mana can pay for an ability of a Dinosaur card in
# a hand: Imposing Vantasaur's "Cycling {1}". Turn 3 the Lorekeeper's {U} (any color) pays the {1} and nothing else is
# tapped, so the Vantasaur is discarded and a card is drawn; the Moxen stay untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Ixalli's Lorekeeper
Imposing Vantasaur
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ixalli's Lorekeeper.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ixalli's Lorekeeper.Activate(Color: Blue)
? Bot1.Mana = {U} (DinosaurSpellsOrAbilities)
Bot1.Hand.Imposing Vantasaur.Activate(Ability: Cycling; Spend: U DinosaurSpellsOrAbilities)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Graveyard = Imposing Vantasaur
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Tapped = false
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
